<title>GREECE: Greek 1M ATHIBOR firms to 13.04 from 13.00pct.</title>
<headline>Greek 1M ATHIBOR firms to 13.04 from 13.00pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate (Athibor) for one month rose to 13.04 percent from 13.00 percent on Thursday and the bid rate (Athibid) increased to 12.55 from 12.52 percent.</p>
